    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομποφᾰκελορρήμων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>,
